From: keptn42 <keptn42@noreply.codeberg.org>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 18:06:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] deploy/grafana: a dashboard for /metrics, on Prometheus
 or VictoriaMetrics
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Throughput, prompt tokens by source, speculative decoding by draft
position, scheduler steps, latency, prefix cache and HTTP, from both
metric families. Plain PromQL, so the same JSON runs on Prometheus and on
VictoriaMetrics. Window ratios are counter ratios with the definitions of
the since-start gauges; conditional acceptance at position j in a window
is reached(j+1) / reached(j).

GUIDE: draft_position_acceptance_ratio is cumulative since start
(draft.h), and the dashboard is named under §6.3.
